//! Versioned, point-in-time investment decision state.
//!
//! This module deliberately does not ask an LLM to recreate a thesis on every
//! request.  It projects the currently verified company-rating inputs into a
//! durable decision record that can later be replayed, evaluated and used as a
//! training trajectory.  Missing crowding, financial or valuation evidence is
//! kept missing instead of being imputed.

